From: OpenWrt RTL port
Subject: [PATCH] G6: port WR1500 RTL8832BR to Linux 6.6 and cfg80211 6.12

WR1500-only PCI binding, checked DMA ownership, nl80211-only control,
OEM RFE50/AP_5G selection and Linux regulatory restrictions.

